      "Intent boundaries failed: disposable_card_limits -> get_disposable_virtual_card (train:5/train:36), order_physical_card -> card_delivery_estimate (train:28), receiving_money -> country_support (train:30), and supported_cards_and_currencies -> fiat_currency_support (train:39)."
    ],
    "winning_patterns": [
      "Explicit object and state worked: pending top-up (train:22), pending cash withdrawal (train:46), pending transfer (train:47), and virtual-card malfunction (train:49).",
      "Direct security/access signals worked: lost card (train:3), PIN exhaustion (train:25), forgotten app passcode (train:41), and lost phone/new-device access (train:43).",
